title: "obdeect: Photon streams, atmospheric propagation, light sources and ray tracing for imaging atmospheric Cherenkov telescopes"
version: 0.8.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: BSD-3-Clause
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/gammasim/obdeect"
authors:
  - given-names: Gernot
    family-names: Maier
    affiliation: DESY
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9868-4700'
keywords:
  - Cherenkov telescopes
  - IACT
  - photon streams
  - atmospheric propagation
  - light sources
  - ray tracing
  - simulation
abstract: "Photon-level simulation for imaging atmospheric Cherenkov telescopes: a versioned photon-stream format with EventIO adapters to CORSIKA and sim_telarray, atmospheric propagation (extinction, refraction, timing, single scattering), artificial light sources, and optical ray tracing through telescope optics and structure. Standard-library-only C++20 cores with Python APIs."
